# atomic sandbox replay v1
# M5 "Drag far -> fallback lights up, the model learns" and fix rounds 3-4 "once it falls back it
# comes back" (re-check by hand: drag H2 far apart while playing, then let go): the estimated
# solver samples H2 (the automatic pass, about 40 s) and plays on the model; with nucleus 1 pinned
# (so the pull stretches the bond instead of towing the molecule) a Select-drag pulls nucleus 0
# out toward 3.34 Bohr from nucleus 1 and holds it there for 1.5 s; the wheel during the drag
# raises the pull from 0.1 to 0.1 x 1.25^5 = 0.305 Ha/Bohr (UI checklist "drag pull").
# Asserted: the pull; the bond stretched past 2.8 Bohr; at least one step since the mark was a
# DFT fallback; after the release the model answers again (`wait source surrogate`, polled), it
# kept at least one new sample and refitted at least once, and after 400 more steps at most 10 %
# of the last 100 steps fell back (a ratio: the single latest step flickers while playing). How
# many fallbacks the drag causes depends on the machine (wall-paced input against a 16 ms tick).
view 1400 900
action smooth-motion false
# pinned at the merge of main (2026-10-14): written for the presets' own 49^3 x 0.25 grid (Balanced)
# without container walls, before the app defaulted to Accurate (81^3) with walls on; H2 is the
# R = 1.6 Bohr scene it was written for (h2_r16.scene; the h2 preset is 1.45 Bohr now)
action quality balanced
action walls off 4.5
scene h2_r16.scene
wait idle
action backend estimated
wait idle
action tool select
t 100 cursor 0.1043005 0.0244677
action play
wait steps 20
mark
action pin 1 true
t 200 button left down
t 210 wheel 5
t 240 cursor 0.1543005 0.0244677
wait ms 50
t 290 cursor 0.2043005 0.0244677
wait ms 50
t 340 cursor 0.2543005 0.0244677
wait ms 50
t 390 cursor 0.3043005 0.0244677
wait ms 50
t 440 cursor 0.3543005 0.0244677
wait ms 50
t 490 cursor 0.4043005 0.0244677
wait ms 1500
expect pull 0.30 0.31
expect max-dist 0 1 2.8
expect fallbacks 1
t 1990 button left up
action pin 1 false
wait source surrogate
wait steps 400
expect new-samples 1
expect new-epochs 1
expect fallback-fraction 0.1
action pause
wait idle
expect no-error
